          "question": "e-5182",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Using a Laplace expansion along the $4$th row, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 7 & 9 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| & =(-6)\\cdot {C}_{41}+0\\cdot {C}_{42}+0\\cdot {C}_{43}+1\\cdot {C}_{44} \\\\  & =(-6)\\cdot (-1)^{4+1}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 7 & 9 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{aligned}|+1\\cdot (-1)^{4+4}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =6\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 7 & 9 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{aligned}|+|\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 7 & 9 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
